---

Third-party content in this repository keeps its own licence and is not covered
by the MIT licence above:

- deploy/etch-app/world/: open-source boards from GitHub. Each board's author,
  repository, commit and licence (GPL, CC-BY-SA, CERN-OHL and others) are in its
  meta.json and on its page in the app.
- vendor/espressif-kicad-libraries/: Espressif KiCad library, CC-BY-SA 4.0 (see
  its PROVENANCE.md).
- engine/parts/cache/: parts fetched from LCSC/EasyEDA and GitHub. Where each one
  came from is recorded in engine/parts/agent_index.json ("provenance").
- agent/firmware_packs/*/: see each pack's PROVENANCE.md.
- KiCad libraries used at run time: CC-BY-SA 4.0 with the KiCad libraries
  exception.
